OL,3,GNEWSAGardai and RUC were 'very close'
OL,4,Ain Omagh bomb investigation - detective
OL,5,
OL,6,FIrish police had a "very close" working
OL,7,Frelationship with the Royal Ulster
OL,8,FConstabulary (RUC) in the Omagh bombing
OL,9,Finvestigation, the inquiry into the
OL,10,Fatrocity has heard.
OL,12,FDet Supt Casserly of An Garda Siochana
OL,13,F(the Irish police force) said the
OL,14,Fresponse by officers in the Republic of
OL,15,FIreland was "immediate" and "very, very
OL,16,Flarge".
OL,18,FHis evidence was given through a
OL,19,Fpre-recorded video, gathered by the
OL,20,Finquiry in Dublin in September.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
