OL,4,Ain Omagh bomb investigation - detective
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Sup Casserly said the gardai
OL,7,Finvestigation started "as soon as that
OL,8,Fvehicle was identified" in relation to
OL,9,Fthe car that carried the bomb.
